<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Purse</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>purse
</pre>
<p>Shows the coins you carry, platinum first, down to iron: for example 
"3 gold pieces" and "12 copper pieces". It shows only the money you carry, 
not what is in the bank. It works at any time, even when you are stunned 
or asleep.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Money</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bank</a>
</pre>




</div>